1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Nhắc Đúng Việc turns a screenshot from a class chat into a checklist and reminders for parents.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
This fictional sample contains two messages about the same parent meeting. The app reads the image locally with OCR.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:33,000
One message says 8:00 on September 28; another says 9:00. Both original lines remain visible as evidence.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The app flags the conflict and will not export a calendar event until a parent verifies and chooses an hour.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:55,000
For this demonstration, I select 9:00. In real life, the parent should check with the teacher first.

6
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The pen and notebook become a checklist item. The information-form deadline also keeps a link to its source line.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:22,000
The downloaded calendar file contains the confirmed meeting hour and the submission deadline, each with an alert.

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
The parent remains in control of uncertain details. The app does not choose between conflicting messages.
